CODEGEN.md §2.8, DECISIONS 279 (one finding per cause): a ts types emit decodes every class, so a field holding a record of a package whose ts emit is baked is E8018 alone, at the emit, without gen/ts's ForeignDataRecord at the field.
-- b/b.canon --
package b

/// A shape.
variant Shape {
  /// A dot.
  dot
}

emit ts { out: "@features/b/b.ts" }
-- a/a.canon --
package a

import b { Shape }

/// A place.
record Place {
  /// Its shapes.
  shapes: [Shape]
  /// Maybe one.
  main: Shape?
}

emit ts { out: "@features/a/a.ts", mode: types }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8018]  a/a.canon:13:6
  b.Shape is decoded from JSON by ts, but package b is emitted in baked mode

1 error, 0 warnings in 2 packages (…)
